  CF-worst (all-1 = golden) ratios among a,b<=13: []
  longest all-1 CF: 0 at []  (consecutive Fibonaccis)

  covering-min witness t* = 14/183 = 14/183 : CF = [0, 13, 14] = [0; 13, 14] (LARGE quotients => FAST convergence => ANTI-golden)
  Its 1/M = Phi6/n = 183/14 : CF = [13, 14] = [13; 14]  (the S71 ladder [n-1; n]).

